	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0601_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうでしたか？　うみの　なかの
ポケモンには　あんなふうに▽
せかいが　みえているんですよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T09:38:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どうでしたか？　海中で　暮らす
ポケモンには　あんな風に▽
世界が　みえているんですよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T09:39:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T09:36:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>INFORMATIONW
受付嬢</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T09:36:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
