	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0601_ambrella_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしの　パラソルの　なかには
わざマシンが　いっぱい　なの！▽
あなたも　おひとつ　いかが？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T02:54:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T02:54:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしの　パラソルの　中には
わざマシンが　いっぱい　なの！▽
あなたも　おひとつ　いかが？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T02:54:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
